         <p>Billed monthly, currently by UK Direct Debit, with other payment rails added as firms in new markets come on board. No setup fee. Quickler runs on any inspection or checklist, not just one trade, and <a href="/pages/global-field-compliance.html">works in any country</a> WhatsApp does.</p>
